{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3151840/extras/4e32a52924d7316222d3bcadc29bb741.avif?t=1769623440\" width=780 height=97 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Umblight is a Inscryption-like card game adventure where you're trapped in a dark, machine-filled room that changes as you go. Build your deck of shadow and light cards, make new cards by combining them and play mind-bending synergies as you try to defeat your dungeon master!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3151840/extras/ace97d3abb3540d76375dab14a7e7c40.poster.avif?t=1769623440\" width=780 height=390 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3151840/extras/ace97d3abb3540d76375dab14a7e7c40.webm?t=1769623440\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3151840/extras/ace97d3abb3540d76375dab14a7e7c40.mp4?t=1769623440\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A fast-paced card game based around modern synergistic combos</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Strategically place and combine your cards on the board</strong>. <strong>Light cards</strong> are defensive and gain a damage blocking shield when you place them, while <strong>shadow cards</strong> damage the opponent through the opponent's cards.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Card skills</strong> have unique trigger conditions that must be met for them to activate. <strong>Build insane chains of skills</strong> to gain a massive advantage over the enemy!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3151840/extras/dda69d10bd10de2fc4af389e3b8e20a0.poster.avif?t=1769623440\" width=780 height=390 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3151840/extras/dda69d10bd10de2fc4af389e3b8e20a0.webm?t=1769623440\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3151840/extras/dda69d10bd10de2fc4af389e3b8e20a0.mp4?t=1769623440\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Build your deck of shadow and light cards.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Combine and modify your cards to build the most powerful deck you could imagine!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Upgrade your player card</strong> with up to 3 abilities that tweak the core of your entire playstyle, but be careful as these abilities always have a downside you'll have to play around.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3151840/extras/ec07c54724fd605c277b4d7c670d45b3.poster.avif?t=1769623440\" width=780 height=390 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3151840/extras/ec07c54724fd605c277b4d7c670d45b3.webm?t=1769623440\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3151840/extras/ec07c54724fd605c277b4d7c670d45b3.mp4?t=1769623440\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Coins are what now?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Yeah, they're cards too. Use them as a <strong>free and zero-cost support card</strong> in your battles to <strong>get out of a tight scenario</strong> or to strategically change your cards... or you can just save them to <strong>trade for more powerful cards</strong> at the shop. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3151840/extras/d247954fbafb121ea8d806894cb0ae3b.poster.avif?t=1769623440\" width=780 height=260 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3151840/extras/d247954fbafb121ea8d806894cb0ae3b.webm?t=1769623440\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3151840/extras/d247954fbafb121ea8d806894cb0ae3b.mp4?t=1769623440\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Choose your own way</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Each playthrough is its own experiment.</strong> Different enemies, rewards, and card synergies will push you to rethink your approach. The core loop rewards creativity: try a new combination, see what clicks, and refine it for the next run.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3151840?t=1769623440","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3151840/1d8213ef4a43c4a21525e472cec3d4b3b31bdbc8/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1769623440","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3151840/26b27663a3b620931c43306e9844bc01f01899f1/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1769623440","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3151840/26b27663a3b620931c43306e9844bc01f01899f1/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1769623440","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Keyboard Only Option","id":75},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3151840/extras/4e32a52924d7316222d3bcadc29bb741.avif?t=1769623440\" width=780 height=97 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Umblight is a Inscryption-like card game adventure where you're trapped in a dark, machine-filled room that changes as you go. Build your deck of shadow and light cards, make new cards by combining them and play mind-bending synergies as you try to defeat your dungeon master!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3151840/extras/ace97d3abb3540d76375dab14a7e7c40.poster.avif?t=1769623440\" width=780 height=390 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3151840/extras/ace97d3abb3540d76375dab14a7e7c40.webm?t=1769623440\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3151840/extras/ace97d3abb3540d76375dab14a7e7c40.mp4?t=1769623440\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A fast-paced card game based around modern synergistic combos</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Strategically place and combine your cards on the board</strong>. <strong>Light cards</strong> are defensive and gain a damage blocking shield when you place them, while <strong>shadow cards</strong> damage the opponent through the opponent's cards.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Card skills</strong> have unique trigger conditions that must be met for them to activate. <strong>Build insane chains of skills</strong> to gain a massive advantage over the enemy!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3151840/extras/dda69d10bd10de2fc4af389e3b8e20a0.poster.avif?t=1769623440\" width=780 height=390 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3151840/extras/dda69d10bd10de2fc4af389e3b8e20a0.webm?t=1769623440\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3151840/extras/dda69d10bd10de2fc4af389e3b8e20a0.mp4?t=1769623440\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Build your deck of shadow and light cards.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Combine and modify your cards to build the most powerful deck you could imagine!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Upgrade your player card</strong> with up to 3 abilities that tweak the core of your entire playstyle, but be careful as these abilities always have a downside you'll have to play around.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3151840/extras/ec07c54724fd605c277b4d7c670d45b3.poster.avif?t=1769623440\" width=780 height=390 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3151840/extras/ec07c54724fd605c277b4d7c670d45b3.webm?t=1769623440\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3151840/extras/ec07c54724fd605c277b4d7c670d45b3.mp4?t=1769623440\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Coins are what now?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Yeah, they're cards too. Use them as a <strong>free and zero-cost support card</strong> in your battles to <strong>get out of a tight scenario</strong> or to strategically change your cards... or you can just save them to <strong>trade for more powerful cards</strong> at the shop. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3151840/extras/d247954fbafb121ea8d806894cb0ae3b.poster.avif?t=1769623440\" width=780 height=260 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3151840/extras/d247954fbafb121ea8d806894cb0ae3b.webm?t=1769623440\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3151840/extras/d247954fbafb121ea8d806894cb0ae3b.mp4?t=1769623440\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Choose your own way</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Each playthrough is its own experiment.</strong> Different enemies, rewards, and card synergies will push you to rethink your approach. The core loop rewards creativity: try a new combination, see what clicks, and refine it for the next run.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["Kristoff Red"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3151840/c9c609c0da725b8688b988b9fc12f5a9fac0a997/header.jpg?t=1769623440","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Any Steam-compatible Linux Distro<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i3<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> OpenGLCore or Vulkan c